,"name":"Jerusalem","kind":"City","lat":31.77667,"lon":35.23417,"summary":"Called also Salem, Ariel, Jebus, the “city of God,” the “holy city;” by the modern Arabs el-Khuds, meaning “the holy;” once “the city of Judah” (2 Chr. 25:28).","verses":754,"v":[29]},{"id":"cush_312","name":"Cush","kind":"Region","lat":21.95979,"lon":31.34356,"summary":"A son, probably the eldest, of Ham, and the father of Nimrod (Gen. 10:8; 1 Chr. 1:10). From him the land of Cush seems to have derived its name.","verses":16,"v":[31]},{"id":"egypt_362","name":"Egypt","kind":"Region (Country)","lat":26.4902,"lon":29.8808,"summary":"The land of the Nile and the pyramids, the oldest kingdom of which we have any record, holds a place of great significance in Scripture.","verses":564,"v":[31]}],"events":[],"traditions":[],"sources":["JFB","MHCC","TDavid","Wesley"],"tags":{"bsb":[[5329,5329,5329,4210,4210,1732,1732,7892,7892,430,6965,341,341,6327,6327,8130,8130,8130,8130,8130,5127,6440,6440],[6227,6227,5086,5086,5086,5086,5086,5086,5086,5086,1749,1749,4549,6440,784,784,7563,7563,6,6,6440,6440,6440,430,430],[6662,6662,6662,8055,8055,8055,5970,5970,6440,430,7797,7797,7797,8057,8057],[7891,430,430,2167,2167,8034,8034,8034,5549,7392,7392,7392,6160,6160,6160,8034,3050,3050,3050,5937,6440,6440],[1,1,3490,3490,3490,1781,1781,1781,490,490,430,430,6944,6944,6944,4583],[430,3427,3173,3173,1004,1004,3318,3318,615,615,615,3574,3574,389,5637,5637,7931,6707,6707,6707,6707],[430,430,3318,3318,3318,3318,6440,5971,5971,6805,6805,6805,3452,3452,3452,5542],[776,776,7493,637,8064,8064,5197,5197,5197,6440,430,2088,2088,5514,5514,6440,430,430,430,3478,3478],[5130,5130,5071,1653,430,430,859,3559,3811,3811,5159],[2416,2416,3427,0,430,430,2896,2896,2896,3559,3559,6041,6041,6041],[136,136,5414,562,562,7227,7227,6635,1319,1319,1319,1319],[4428,6635,6635,6635,5074,5074,5074,5116,5116,5116,1004,1004,2505,7998,7998],[518,7901,7901,7901,996,8240,8240,3671,3671,3123,3123,3123,2645,2645,3701,3701,3422,3422,3422,84,84,2742],[7706,